---
layout: base.njk
title: Industry Insights
description: "Weekly editorial: one deep analytical take on what AI-assisted development means for teams, products, and the industry."
---

<header class="newsletter-header">
  <div class="newsletter-label">Weekly</div>
  <h1>Industry Insights</h1>
  <p class="newsletter-desc">Weekly editorial — one deep analytical take connecting the dots across AI dev, accessibility, and agent ecosystem news. Written for people making product and technical decisions.</p>
  <p class="ai-disclaimer">⚠️ AI-generated from public web sources. Not authored by Amit. Personal briefing tool to keep up with the space.</p>
</header>

<main>
{% set posts = collections["industry-insights"] %}
{% if posts and posts.length > 0 %}
  <ol class="post-list" reversed>
  {% for post in posts | reverse %}
    <li>
      <time>{{ post.date | humanDate }}</time>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      {% if post.data.summary %}<p class="summary">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ol>
{% else %}
  <p class="empty-state">First edition pending.</p>
{% endif %}
</main>
